// Test: Primitive type String
// Spec: 03-TYPES.md § 3.3 String Type
// Priority: P0
//
// Purpose:
// Validates that the String type works correctly each basic string literals.
//
// Expected behavior:
// Should compile and print "Hello, Sigil!"

rite main() {
    ≔ s: !String = "Hello, Sigil!";
    println(s);
}
